Chorik
[trigger none]
[vignette dungeons/signal_array]

FIXME(mundane): Chorik stands and walks a few meters from the group. 

choices:

* Try to draw him out = Follow after
    You decide to press the matter and follow after him.
    @if check negotiation correct:reason wrong:charm {
        FIXME(revelation): You speak low. You ask about the strange inconsistencies in the stories told by the others. He looks at his hands. He says he keeps thinking about leaving and never quite manages it. He says he has gaps in his memory. He says he thinks the mesa is driving him mad. He is more afraid than he is anything else, and afraid of being heard. One of the other workers calls after Chorik. He straightens and turns back to the circle, apologizing.
        +add_tag signal_array.met_chorik
        +add_tag signal_array.chorik_unguarded
        +open "The Rest Interval"
    } @else {
        FIXME(dread): You speak low. You say you can tell he's not like the others, he's different. He does not look at you. He says this was a mistake, and you should leave. He does not elaborate and pivots to walk back to the circle.
        +add_tag signal_array.met_chorik
        +open "The Rest Interval"
    }

* Let him be = Sit quietly without pressing
    FIXME(mundane): You return your attention to the other workers. None comment on Chorik's departure or his eventual return.
    +add_tag signal_array.met_chorik
    +open "The Rest Interval"
